    "detailed_description": "<h1>DON'T FORGET TO ADD IT TO YOUR STEAM WISHLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/14208d2d88b7a566893cd7944e0fa04e.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Korean Translators : Haram Eom , Jihyeon Kim</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/9bf48bd06859ed4dc376d288dab519bd.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hellmate is a roguelike deck-building game inspired by chess, where you focus on creating powerful synergies with cards to kill the opposing king piece as quickly as possible</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to play pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your mana as efficiently as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/6d64b63cf3ae7b7f2df7ee1d6d8c61a4.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/6d64b63cf3ae7b7f2df7ee1d6d8c61a4.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/6d64b63cf3ae7b7f2df7ee1d6d8c61a4.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemy pieces to remove any threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/145c463e7438fa18a65de770e2549306.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/145c463e7438fa18a65de770e2549306.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/145c463e7438fa18a65de770e2549306.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage points only affect the king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the enemy king in the shortest round time and move forward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/42d3a7b89f731f6c87293601f75db8e9.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/42d3a7b89f731f6c87293601f75db8e9.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/42d3a7b89f731f6c87293601f75db8e9.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the king patterns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your strategy around your enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/4891c9e5bf566bee1514b8c40f35c2c4.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/4891c9e5bf566bee1514b8c40f35c2c4.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/4891c9e5bf566bee1514b8c40f35c2c4.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/11ad0e461ef31097c306358ed700f4d7.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your deck with <strong>unique</strong> Spell and Piece cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/ecfbf054427f7ab8c657f8552dd03071.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/ecfbf054427f7ab8c657f8552dd03071.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/ecfbf054427f7ab8c657f8552dd03071.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>Consumable and Joker card</strong> you pick can significantly impact your game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/988dbb7a4c41a25f6df26806c1ef2815.avif?t=1749912357\" width=609 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/afb72af92fb7eb31c49c73b89f87849b.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique roguelike chess experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run has 7 randomly generated floors, each themed after one of the 7 deadly sins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/f6fb161efce1477ac148e45aacbe23ed.poster.avif?t=1749912357\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/f6fb161efce1477ac148e45aacbe23ed.webm?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/f6fb161efce1477ac148e45aacbe23ed.mp4?t=1749912357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
